From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LeavesX Build <build@leavesx.local>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 19:12:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Move AI distance-key computation off the tick thread for
 beta146

Large AI target scans still spent their coordinate-distance arithmetic on the tick thread before entering the worker pool. Fuse immutable snapshot key generation with each parallel sort or nearest-target range, then retain a full synchronous recomputation fallback.

